# Wizard Directory Structure & Textual TUI Implementation Report

**Date**: Feb 3, 2026  
**Scope**: filter_lib/wizard/ directory structure, recent migration to Textual, class responsibilities, and TUI patterns

---

## 1. Current File Structure & Purpose

### Core Application Architecture
```
filter_lib/wizard/
├── __init__.py                    # Public API exports (run_wizard)
├── interactive.py                 # Entry point launcher
├── app.py                         # Main FilterWizardApp (Textual App)
